@startuml BudgetDarpanEndToEndFlow
!include _theme.puml
title Budget Darpan — End-to-End System Flow
caption From public evidence to an accountable citizen action

start
:Open Budget Darpan;
:Select language, municipality,\nward, fiscal year, sector or project;
:Load structured project overview;

fork
  :Render allocation, award, payment,\nprogress and evidence coverage;
fork again
  :Render chart and project map\nwhen values/coordinates exist;
fork again
  :Show Unknown / Not reported\nfor missing evidence;
end fork

if (Ask an investigator question?) then (yes)
  :Accept typed or editable voice transcript;
  :Detect English, Devanagari Nepali\nor Romanized Nepali;
  :Route question intent;
  if (Exact structured fact?) then (yes)
    :Query Neon PostgreSQL\n(SQLite in local mode);
  elseif (Document claim?) then (yes)
    if (Full local RAG available?) then (yes)
      :Retrieve project-filtered\naccepted Chroma document chunks;
    else (hosted preview)
      :Use reviewed evidence metadata,\ncited facts and official source URLs;
    endif
  elseif (Anomaly question?) then (yes)
    :Read deterministic rule, values,\nthreshold and source references;
  else (combined investigation)
    :Combine database facts, timeline,\nretrieved evidence and citizen aggregate;
  endif
  if (Enough reliable evidence?) then (yes)
    :Compose answer in user's language;
    :Return citations and structured\nchart instructions;
  else (no)
    :State insufficient evidence honestly;
  endif
  :User opens cited document page;
endif

if (Submit citizen feedback?) then (yes)
  if (Authenticated?) then (yes)
  else (no)
    :Register or sign in;
  endif
  if (Identity verified?) then (yes)
  else (no)
    :Complete fictional phone + citizenship\n+ OTP verification flow;
    :Backend verifies RS256 assertion;
  endif
  :Derive stable privacy-preserving citizen key;
  if (Feedback already exists?) then (yes)
    :Reject duplicate or allow edit\nof original rating;
  else (no)
    :Store one verified rating\nfor citizen + project;
  endif
endif

:Record sensitive changes in audit log;
stop

legend right
  |= Principle |= Behavior |
  | Public by default | Browse without login |
  | Evidence first | Claims keep provenance |
  | Privacy | No raw citizenship in Budget Darpan |
  | Safety | Anomaly is not proven corruption |
  | Deployment | Vercel SPA + Render services + Neon DB |
endlegend
@enduml
